WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.646
"Ratty! Please stop!" shouted Mole again.

2
00:00:06.647 --> 00:00:09.843
But Rat was far ahead.

3
00:00:09.844 --> 00:00:12.761
"It’s my old home!" cried Mole.

4
00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:15.769
"I must go there!"

5
00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.490
Rat didn’t turn back.

6
00:00:18.491 --> 00:00:22.408
"Hurry up, Mole," Rat called without looking.

7
00:00:22.409 --> 00:00:26.052
"Oh, please come back!" yelled Mole.

8
00:00:26.053 --> 00:00:29.655
He stood in the road alone.

9
00:00:29.656 --> 00:00:32.761
Mole’s home was nearby.

10
00:00:32.762 --> 00:00:35.836
"Should I go home?" he wondered.

11
00:00:35.837 --> 00:00:38.560
"Or should I go with my friend?"

12
00:00:38.561 --> 00:00:42.110
The choice made his heart ache.

13
00:00:42.111 --> 00:00:46.033
With a sigh, Mole ran after Rat.

14
00:00:46.034 --> 00:00:48.642
Finally Mole caught up.

15
00:00:48.643 --> 00:00:52.848
"Won’t it be great to sit by the fire?" asked Rat.

16
00:00:52.849 --> 00:00:59.102
"Sure," said Mole, dragging his feet.

17
00:00:59.103 --> 00:01:02.239
Rat turned and looked at Mole.

18
00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:06.080
"Mole, you’re tired. Sit down," said Rat.

19
00:01:06.081 --> 00:01:08.965
Mole sat on a fallen log.

20
00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:15.899
His lips trembled, and he burst into tears.

21
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.794
"What is it, Mole?" asked Rat, surprised.

22
00:01:20.795 --> 00:01:25.689
"I know it’s not cozy like your house," sobbed Mole.

23
00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.745
"Or grand like Toad Hall.

24
00:01:28.746 --> 00:01:32.970
But it was mine!"

25
00:01:32.971 --> 00:01:36.321
"What was yours?" asked Rat.

26
00:01:36.322 --> 00:01:42.550
"I went away and forgot all about it," cried Mole.

27
00:01:42.551 --> 00:01:46.177
"Then I smelled it again."

28
00:01:46.178 --> 00:01:49.696
"But what did you smell?" Rat asked.

29
00:01:49.697 --> 00:01:53.354
"My home!" sobbed Mole.

30
00:01:53.355 --> 00:01:56.183
"It was my old home!

31
00:01:56.184 --> 00:02:04.705
And you wouldn’t turn back!"

